@startuml SequenceDiagramDiegeticUI
' Sequence Diagram: Diegetic UI Navigation, Depth Stacking & Audio Flow

autonumber
actor User
participant "GuildEnvironment.vue\n(Stage)" as Stage
participant "GuildArchPortal.vue\n(Hotspot)" as Hotspot
participant "GuildLibraryPortal.vue\n(Spritesheet)" as LibraryDoor
participant "uiGuildStore (Pinia)" as Store
participant "useGuildAudio (Web Audio API)" as Audio
participant "Nuxt Router" as Router

== 1. User Hovers Interactive Hotspot ==
User -> LibraryDoor : Hover sobre Porta da Biblioteca
LibraryDoor -> LibraryDoor : Avana Sprite (Frames 0 -> 9)
LibraryDoor -> Audio : playDoorOpenSound()
Audio -> Audio : Trigger Oscillator / Buffer (Pitch Shift)

== 2. User Clicks Hotspot / Portal ==
User -> Hotspot : Click no Arco das Misses
Hotspot -> Audio : playFootsteps()
Hotspot -> Store : triggerCameraZoom({ scale: 2.8, x: '11%', y: '50%' })
Store -> Stage : Apply CSS transform: scale(2.8) translate(...)
Store -> Store : setRoom('tasks')

== 3. Page Transition & Layout Mount ==
Store -> Router : navigateTo('/tasks')
Router -> Stage : Load Tasks Route (/tasks)
Stage -> Stage : Render Layer 1 (tasks-web.webp background)
Stage -> Stage : Mount Layer 3 (Anchored HUD + Wooden Kanban)

== 4. Mute Preference Sync ==
User -> Stage : Toggle Mute Button on Top Banner
Stage -> Audio : setMuteState(isMuted)
Audio -> Store : persistAudioSettings({ muted: true })
Store -> Store : Write to localStorage('guild_audio_mute')

@enduml
